    aboutDesc: 'A LAN chat tool built on Node.js + Socket.IO + WebRTC. Supports direct messages, group chats, voice/video calls, moments, red packets, wallet, and file transfer. All data is stored locally on the server under ./files — no public cloud service is used.',
